  "prefLabel": "Rko 102.03 Telephone Number of Office",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rko 102.03 Telephone Number of Office.\n\n(a) The telephone number of the office is (603) 271-3277.\n\n(b) In the event of a change in telephone number, the office may be contacted through the office of the New Hampshire secretary of state, (603) 271-3242.\n\nSource. #13921, eff 5-20-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rko100-200.html"
